@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

title Component and Connector View - Lab 5 Security Patterns (Jun 2026)

actor "Web User" as User

rectangle "subnet_a - Public Zone" #LightBlue {
  component "Frontend Web\n(Next.js 14)" as Frontend
  component "Reverse Proxy / API Gateway\n(Nginx)\n──────────────────\n• TLS termination (HTTPS :8443)\n• HTTP→HTTPS redirect (:8000→301)\n• Rate limiting zones:\n  general: 10r/s burst 20\n  ai_zone: 2r/s  burst 5\n• CORS + security headers\n• HSTS enforcement" as Gateway
}

rectangle "subnet_b - Private Zone" #LightYellow {
  component "Auth Service\n(FastAPI)" as Auth
  component "User Service\n(FastAPI)" as UserService
  component "Product Service\n(FastAPI)" as Product
  component "Order Service\n(FastAPI)" as Order
  component "AI Service\n(FastAPI)\n────────────────\nRedis Rate Limiter\n10 req / 60s per user|IP\nSliding window" as AI

  database "Auth PostgreSQL" as AuthDB
  database "User PostgreSQL" as UserDB
  database "Order PostgreSQL" as OrderDB
  database "Product PostgreSQL" as ProductDB
  database "Redis\n(cache + rate limit\ncounters)" as Redis
  queue "RabbitMQ\n(event bus)" as MQ
}

User --> Frontend       : Browser HTTPS
Frontend --> Gateway    : HTTPS (TLS)\n**[Secure Channel]**

Gateway --> Auth        : HTTP /auth/*\n[Rate Limited]
Gateway --> UserService : HTTP /users/* /internal/*\n[Rate Limited]
Gateway --> Product     : HTTP /products/*\n[Rate Limited]
Gateway --> Order       : HTTP /orders/*\n[Rate Limited]
Gateway --> AI          : HTTP /ai/*\n[Rate Limited - strict]

note on link
  **Reverse Proxy Pattern**
  Clients never reach
  backend directly
end note

Auth --> AuthDB         : users
Auth --> Redis          : token sessions + blacklist
Auth --> MQ             : AUTH_USER_REGISTERED

UserService --> UserDB  : profiles + addresses
MQ --> UserService      : profile creation events

Product --> ProductDB   : products + categories
Product --> Redis       : cache
Product --> UserService : seller profile lookup

Order --> OrderDB       : orders + order_items
Order --> Product       : /internal/products/*
Order --> MQ            : ORDER_CREATED / UPDATED / CANCELLED

AI --> Redis            : rate_limit:ai:<user|ip>\nsliding window counter
AI --> Product          : product catalog
AI --> UserService      : user context
AI --> Order            : order history

note top of Gateway
  **[Pattern 1] Network Segmentation**
  Gateway bridges subnet_a ↔ subnet_b.
  No backend is reachable from subnet_a directly.
  DBs and queues isolated in subnet_b only.
end note

note top of AI
  **[Pattern 3] Rate Limiting**
  Layer 1 → NGINX: 2r/s burst 5
  Layer 2 → Redis middleware: 10r/60s
  Returns 429 + Retry-After header
  X-RateLimit-* headers on every response
end note

note bottom of Frontend
  **[Pattern 2] Secure Channel**
  All traffic encrypted via TLS 1.2/1.3
  HTTP redirected to HTTPS (301)
  HSTS: max-age=31536000
  Self-signed cert (RSA 2048, CN=localhost)
end note

@enduml
